WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:05.964
♪♪

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.426
Snow:
Parisian couture...

00:00:09.426 --> 00:00:09.759
[camera flash]

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:13.304
Snow:
...could influence how thousands of
ordinary women...

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:15.557
dream and live.

00:00:17.726 --> 00:00:19.352
Snow:
But fashion needs a new leader.

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:23.648
Snow:
A figurehead.

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:30.989
Woman:
Monsieur Dior.

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:33.658
[cheering]

00:00:35.452 --> 00:00:37.704
SNOW:
I keep looking for the great collection-

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:38.580
[camera flash]

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.665
SNOW:
-to rise from the ashes of the war.

00:00:41.082 --> 00:00:41.708
["Haute" by Janelle Monáe plays]

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.919
Monsieur Dior, what do you desire?

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:49.132
Dior:
To design the most beautiful
women's clothing that ever existed.

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:49.758
♪ They say I look haute ♪

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.886
Christian Dior ruined French couture.

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:54.596
Coco:
And I'm coming back to save it.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:55.847
[mimics perfume]

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:59.350
Dior:
For those of us who lived
through the chaos of war,

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:02.771
creation was survival.

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:07.400
Elsa:
The legend of Coco Chanel.

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:09.235
Elsa:
If people only knew.

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:12.405
♪ If I keep on givin' 'em
looks that can kill ♪

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.616
♪ They gon' have to come and arrest me ♪

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.993
Chanel can be very treacherous.

00:01:17.118 --> 00:01:17.702
Oh yes.

00:01:17.827 --> 00:01:18.995
["My Heart is Full" by Norah Jones plays]

00:01:19.704 --> 00:01:21.998
Are you happy with
the revolution you started?

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:23.041
♪ Eyes are wide ♪

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.000
Dior:
There is the truth,

00:01:24.334 --> 00:01:25.668
♪ My mind is free ♪

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:29.255
but there is always another
truth that lives behind it.

00:01:29.672 --> 00:01:31.257
Your sister, she's not safe.

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.927
Lucien:
Creation cannot stop the bullets.

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:37.013
But creation is our way forward.

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:39.390
Our choices matter.

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:40.350
♪ I am standing ♪

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:44.395
♪ Use my arms ♪

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:48.066
♪ Use my legs ♪

00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:50.777
♪ Use my hands ♪

00:01:52.529 --> 00:01:54.197
♪ Use my heart ♪

00:01:54.197 --> 00:01:56.157
Devin:
Your house will be magnificent.

00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:57.283
♪ Use my voice ♪

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:58.326
You think Dior is fashion?

00:01:59.118 --> 00:02:00.662
♪ I will rise ♪

00:02:00.662 --> 00:02:03.248
Real talent is turning your
life into something bigger.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.293
♪ I will rise ♪

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:09.504
People need to feel.

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:10.964
Dior:
Dream.

00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:12.882
Dior:
They need to live again.

00:02:13.675 --> 00:02:16.636
Dior:
We can create a new world for them.

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:20.056
♪♪

